# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it) for tonight's four-card window.
# E3: tonight's T3 (G1 general-tp4, native vLLM, no speculative decoding) run EARLY on today's serving image tp4-serve-2, while
# tp4-serve-3 is still in review and CI: the G1 path is the same in both images, and the smoke harness (with the coding-text
# concurrency tests) runs from this job's checkout, so this is G1's coding-text baseline for tonight's comparison.
# Duration (estimate): 15-20 min.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-2
C2_PROFILE=general-tp4
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,long_real_text,concurrent4,concurrent4_steady,concurrent4_code,concurrent4_code_equal
